1 - Map Viewer (Flask + Docker)

A Dockerized Flask web application that visualizes a custom list of cities on an interactive world map using Plotly.
Cities are grouped by category and displayed with colored markers, while countries are highlighted on a choropleth map.

---

## Features

- Interactive world map (Plotly)
- City markers grouped by category
- Country highlighting
- Flask web server

---

## Project Concept

This project separates data into two layers:

- **Static dataset**: `worldcities.csv` (inside Docker image)
- **User dataset**: `cities.csv` (custom list of cities)

This allows the map to be reusable while still customizable.

---

